\pard \pagebb {\fs18 {\cf1\ul {\field\fldedit{\*\fldinst { HYPERLINK "" \\l "BKMK_6"}}{\fldrslt\ul {Table of Contents}}}}}\par
\pard {\fs18 {increased the discounted liability by $7.6 million to $258.8 million (an undiscounted increase of\u160?$11.9 million to $360.3 million), and likewise, a 10% decrease in the price of our\u160?Class A common stock at December\u160?31, 2025 would have decreased the discounted liability by $7.6 million to $243.6 million (an\u160?undiscounted decrease of $11.9 million to $336.6 million).}}\par
