\pard \fi648 {\fs18 {As of December\u160?31, 2025, we have deferred tax assets on U.S. federal net operating loss (\u8220?NOL\u8221?) carryforwards of approximately $0.5 million which can be used to offset U.S. federal and state taxes payable in future years. The U.S. federal NOL carryforwards have no expiration date whereas the U.S. state NOL carryforwards generally will expire in periods beginning in 2041.}}\par
\pard \fi648 \sb216 {\fs18 {As of December\u160?31, 2025, the Company had $5.5 million of unrecognized tax benefits all of which would not impact the effective tax rate if recognized. The Company recognizes the interest related to uncertain tax benefits as a component of income tax expense. No penalties or interest were recognized during the year ended December\u160?31, 2025.}}\par
